{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome Young Alchemist ! \ud83c\udf3f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical Greenhouse\u00a0is a cozy simulation game where you manage your own\u00a0potion shop. Take care of your plants in the Greenhouse, use the Workshop alembic to make potions, organize your shop and grow your business ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837530/extras/b8378997c5365709963b98848440b416.poster.avif?t=1765793093\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837530/extras/b8378997c5365709963b98848440b416.webm?t=1765793093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837530/extras/b8378997c5365709963b98848440b416.mp4?t=1765793093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take care of Plants \ud83c\udf3f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy magical plants, take care of them and harvest the fruits of your work ! You have to manage your Energy wisely to be able to take care of all your plants, and even boost them with your magic power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experiment with Potions \ud83d\udd2e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use ingredients to make potions and remedies via the alembic. You have the choice to craft potions following known recipes or to create potions in an empirical way, losing sometimes the ingredients but also discovering new potions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your Greenhouse \ud83c\udf89</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add some decors and customize the plant pots so it matches the color theme you want! Decors are pretty but they\u2019re also useful, as they have special effects boosting your business capacities (plant growth, craft, energy, automation...)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fill the Quests \ud83d\udcda</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Villagers, creatures and adventurers of all kinds living nearby, have strange requests for you. You will have to be inventive to create the perfect potion for every situation !<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837530/extras/0dcd53be390f9a4665cf36e26b77d7ee.poster.avif?t=1765793093\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837530/extras/0dcd53be390f9a4665cf36e26b77d7ee.webm?t=1765793093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837530/extras/0dcd53be390f9a4665cf36e26b77d7ee.mp4?t=1765793093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Magical Greenhouse, you will expect :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- a Chill Adventure of <strong>3 to 5 hours</strong> were you control the game rhythm\u2028 <br>- <strong>24 Magical Plants</strong> to Collect, Grow and Harvest\u2028<br>- <strong>70 Potions</strong> to Discover and Experiment with\u2028  <br>- <strong>15+ Decorations</strong> to Customize your own\u00a0shop\u2028<br>- <strong>85+ Quests</strong> from Villagers where you\u2019ll influence the village storyline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837530/extras/2abac299ffb98b74eea3cb45c438da5c.poster.avif?t=1765793093\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837530/extras/2abac299ffb98b74eea3cb45c438da5c.webm?t=1765793093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837530/extras/2abac299ffb98b74eea3cb45c438da5c.mp4?t=1765793093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re a small indie team : Lya Mgtt (Illustrator &amp; Designer) creating this colorful universe and Yorack (Developper) bringing our idea to life. We\u2019ve been passionate by video games since a long time, and Magical Greenhouse is our first commercial project ! Our objective is to create a bubble of softness, a short adventure in a peaceful universe, and we hope you\u2019ll like it ! \u2728<br>Music by the amazing Samantha van der Sluis \ud83c\udf38</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3837530/effbdb373f43f4986d64c6059234be1fe834830f.jpg"},{"name":"Great Student","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3837530/c5a39f30d041032a0d5912c496facc9f4240856d.jpg"},{"name":"Music Lover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3837530/fa5a5e4d1aecefac94d657dbd2b8fef28a12a6a8.jpg"},{"name":"Alchemist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3837530/ea1285ccccad297000c15071bed20118436458bd.jpg"},{"name":"Business Owner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3837530/b22dfca1e40c88558a1cdc715491427b3c14db41.jpg"},{"name":"Salesperson","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3837530/232dba75474f102ed09da38b059697c4c7f3fc9f.jpg"},{"name":"Gardener","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3837530/e348a932948085c9876bb5291b12b5840a1d754d.jpg"},{"name":"Herbalist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3837530/452585ea1b5db1ef7a090a94f71ad9a63446e9c6.jpg"},{"name":"Apothecary","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3837530/08